    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Heavenly Lord Bai Zu skewers five cicadas on a tiny bamboo stick above a fire grill while hosting Chu Du. The cicadas are all rank five fire path Gu worms named purple smoke cicada. Once infused with true essence, they can emit purple smoke, obscuring a piece of heaven and earth. In the mortal world each would cause bloodshed among Gu Masters, but here they are just food.",
